-Cross-tenant identifiers return 404 and do not reveal records. List pagination returns items and next_offset; limit is 1–200. Offset pagination is for this bounded MVP and is not a stable snapshot during concurrent inserts.
+A malformed or unavailable provider normally produces an AI run with `trusted=false`, a failure code and ledger, rather than taking down the service. Interrupted AI runs may remain `running` and need operator review; no distributed job/retry system is claimed. Mutation transport timeouts are not permission to resubmit actions. Fetch state before deciding next steps.
